---
/**
 * Web font for the whole site.
 *
 * global.css sets --font-sans to "Inter", system-ui, sans-serif, but only
 * Layout.astro ever loaded Inter. Pages on SiteLayout -- the home page, the
 * calculator, compare, the foods directory and the legal pages -- asked for a
 * font they never fetched, so they fell back to system-ui while the food and
 * learn pages rendered in Inter. Both layouts render this now, so the site is
 * set in one typeface and there is a single place to change it.
 */
---
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link
  href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap"
  rel="stylesheet"
/>
